# HALF: = NewObject {{*}}fields=[0]
# RUN(TWICE): walk f24 mechanisms=all
# TWICE-LABEL: code f24:Body
# TWICE-NOT: = NewObject {{*}}fields=[
# a setter that is laid above in plain sight, by one written descriptor, takes the first store: the record of the class expects it there (accessors-above-objects-out-of-sight-are-run-behind-looks-1),
